tra wide  lens with the 11pro but that's not that  big of a deal the five hours of extra  battery life sounds tempting especially  for gaming but my tennis max already  lasts me all day the main differences  you'll notice on a day to day basis are  the upgraded selfie camera more reliable  face ID faster charger extra camera lens  and extra battery life but are those  things worth upgrading again honestly no  now if Apple got rid of the knotch that  would be a whole nother story if this  video helps you out make sure to tap  that like button and click the circle  above to subscribe and check out some of  our other videos right over there thanks  for watching and we'll see you  the next video
 

